     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRParticipantCorpsLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRParticipantCorpsLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRParticipantCorpsLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMParticipant</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-participant-corps.html\">CDA - FR Participant corpsversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Participant2 (FRCDAParticipant)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Participant2.typeCode</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.period</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Participant2.time (Date et heure de la participation)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMParticipant</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-participant-role.html\">CDA - FR participantRoleversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ParticipantRole.id (Identifiant du participant)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>ParticipantRole.playingEntity (Identité du participant)</td><td>playingEntity (type CDA PlayingEntity) n'est pas décomposé ; le nom y est porté globalement.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.role</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ParticipantRole.code (Type du participant)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant.participantProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ParticipantRole.playingEntity (Identité du participant)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant.participantDevice</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ParticipantRole.playingDevice (Dispositif automatique)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.participant.participantOrganisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>ParticipantRole.scopingEntity (Organisation)</td><td/></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMParticipant</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-actor-extension.html\">FR Actor Extensionversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension (FRActorExtension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:typeCode.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>Extension.extension:actor.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>value[x] est une simple Reference ; l'identifiant n'est pas accessible sans résoudre la référence vers FRPractitionerRoleDocument.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>Extension.extension:actor.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>value[x] est une simple Reference ; le nom n'est pas accessible sans résoudre la référence vers FRPractitionerRoleDocument.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.role</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>Extension.extension:actor.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>value[x] est une simple Reference ; la qualification n'est pas accessible sans résoudre la référence vers FRPractitionerRoleDocument.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMParticipant.period</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Période sans é